    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing for Numbers</strong> is a vibrant, first-person educational adventure where you step into the shoes of an aspiring wizard on a quest to join the prestigious Arcane Anglers Guild. Master increasingly harder equations and catch magical fish to prove your worth and earn your place among the elite!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A unique way to learn math</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open portals to extraordinary math dimensions and unleash your fishing spells to summon magical fish. Harvest their essence to fuel your journey, upgrading your spells and empowering rune stones as you master the art of arcane mathematics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/af2cfaee720f2ae55aa3cd38f8468706.poster.avif?t=1747763813\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/af2cfaee720f2ae55aa3cd38f8468706.webm?t=1747763813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/af2cfaee720f2ae55aa3cd38f8468706.mp4?t=1747763813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a game mode that fits the way you want to play. Classic Mode offers a preset challenge designed by the development team. Custom Mode lets you adjust the difficulty and rules to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/78259aaec998a43548fe06624af4fc99.poster.avif?t=1747763813\" width=458 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/78259aaec998a43548fe06624af4fc99.webm?t=1747763813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/78259aaec998a43548fe06624af4fc99.mp4?t=1747763813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun learning experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a fun and engaging way to learn math, featuring rewarding visuals, a calming atmosphere, and a satisfying sense of progression and achievement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/28387a43effb1170aff4a079cc8167f5.poster.avif?t=1747763813\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/28387a43effb1170aff4a079cc8167f5.webm?t=1747763813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/28387a43effb1170aff4a079cc8167f5.mp4?t=1747763813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing for Numbers</strong> is a vibrant, first-person educational adventure where you step into the shoes of an aspiring wizard on a quest to join the prestigious Arcane Anglers Guild. Master increasingly harder equations and catch magical fish to prove your worth and earn your place among the elite!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A unique way to learn math</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open portals to extraordinary math dimensions and unleash your fishing spells to summon magical fish. Harvest their essence to fuel your journey, upgrading your spells and empowering rune stones as you master the art of arcane mathematics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/af2cfaee720f2ae55aa3cd38f8468706.poster.avif?t=1747763813\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/af2cfaee720f2ae55aa3cd38f8468706.webm?t=1747763813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/af2cfaee720f2ae55aa3cd38f8468706.mp4?t=1747763813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a game mode that fits the way you want to play. Classic Mode offers a preset challenge designed by the development team. Custom Mode lets you adjust the difficulty and rules to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/78259aaec998a43548fe06624af4fc99.poster.avif?t=1747763813\" width=458 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/78259aaec998a43548fe06624af4fc99.webm?t=1747763813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/78259aaec998a43548fe06624af4fc99.mp4?t=1747763813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun learning experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a fun and engaging way to learn math, featuring rewarding visuals, a calming atmosphere, and a satisfying sense of progression and achievement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/28387a43effb1170aff4a079cc8167f5.poster.avif?t=1747763813\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/28387a43effb1170aff4a079cc8167f5.webm?t=1747763813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/28387a43effb1170aff4a079cc8167f5.mp4?t=1747763813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
